This product includes data derived from dexmate-urdf
(https://github.com/dexmate-ai/dexmate-urdf), Copyright 2025 Dexmate Inc.,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
  - kinematics/<variant>/*.urdf, frames.json, visuals.json: serial chains,
    frame offsets and collision geometry derived from Dexmate's robot models
  - kinematics/meshes/*.glb: Dexmate's visual meshes, unmodified
  - kinematics/meshes/*.ply: collision hulls derived from Dexmate's collision meshes

This module depends at runtime on dexcontrol
(https://github.com/dexmate-ai/dexcontrol), which Dexmate distributes under the
GNU AGPL-3.0 or a commercial license. dexcontrol is installed from PyPI and is
not included in this repository.
